{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795778662,"nonce":"dlkrJBKr6JzkxdFxnGcPj1r4Gu8=","title":"A cn context menu given an id closes on a press inside it","message":"ContextMenuBuilder::id replaced the id of the menu panel after the content was built, while the click-outside registration kept the generated id. A press inside the menu was taken as outside it and closed the menu, so a submenu never opened. Reproduced in a headless test: with the id given, the submenu is not mounted after a press on its row.","files":null}]}